{
 "_provenance": "Fixed fights of explorations whose enemy groups the mission's own battle data doesn't hold (battle_content.field_mission_bundle takes a mission's groups by their number, <mission id>nn). `missions`: the scenario battles each mission's own scripts start, read from its map and event packages (script opcode 47 00 04 <scenario battle id>) by ios-server/devtools/scan_scenario_fights.py; the enemy group of each (MissionStartRequest reply, YjHhvN65) is added to the mission's battle data. `stand_ins`: scenario battles whose own group has no enemy data in any record we hold, served with another group instead; each is labeled and approved by the operator. 2026-11-13: The Enchanted Maze (area 221). Its ADV quest's scripts start 35 fights of its own (2210301-2210335): 15 use groups numbered after the BGN and INT quests and the Chambers of Experience and Riches, and two (EXP Lv4, GIL Lv4) have no enemy data anywhere; the wiki's Enchanted Maze page (ios-server/research/wiki/The_Enchanted_Maze.wiki) lists the quest's monsters and door types but not single fights. Its INT quest's map also starts the BGN quest's seven fights.",
